  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Draft writing energy policy review Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project regards facilitating the draft writing of the energy policy review in close cooperation with the main beneficiary partner which is the Kenyan Ministry of Energy and Petroleum.The project is developed in synergy with the programme of the European Union (EU) delegation, which supports other parts of the total energy policy review proces.The draft writing entails processing the inputs of the different working groups on sub-sectors into one text, and a legal check resulting in a first draft version of the energy policy.The final text is experted to be ready in Spring 2025, when it will go to parliament for approval.</narrative>
  </description>
